      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACKPOOL FINN (7) showed blistering pace early and gave a sight when in the minors, beaten 5.5 lengths over 390m Ballarat in 22.39. Comes through a solid form race last start. Top prospect. STOJANOVIC (1) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when second (23.74) over 410m at this track. Can feature again. CHEEKY MILA (8) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 2.75 lengths away in third (25.53) at Shepparton in a Grade 4/5 over 450m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Hard to beat again. MIGHTY MISS (4) is a last-start placegetter in good time - worth considering.",
